Package: causalGBKMR
Title: Causal Inference for Time-Varying Environmental Mixtures via g-BKMR
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("[First]", "[Last]", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "[email]"),
    person("[First]", "[Last]", role = "aut"),
    person("[First]", "[Last]", role = "aut")
    )
Description: Combines the g-formula with Bayesian Kernel Machine Regression
    (BKMR) for causal inference with time-varying correlated environmental
    mixtures. Supports both standard BKMR and fast BKMR (via the 'fbkmr'
    package) for large-sample settings. Estimates average treatment effects
    of exposure mixtures while accounting for time-varying confounding.
